WEBVTT

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:24.280
Please excuse me, Princess.

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:28.750
Cosette, I'd like to
ask you something.

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:31.260
Yes, what is it, Princess?

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.260
Even though my dress is being altered,

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.920
is it really necessary
for me to bathe now?

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:38.650
What are you saying?

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:44.650
Ladies are expected to demonstrate
exemplary cleanliness at the masked ball.

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:48.770
I brought my personal lotion
with me just for the occasion.

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:52.780
What do you plan on
doing with that?

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:57.330
An upper-body massage that will be better than last time.

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:02.950
Now, Princess, shall we begin?

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:09.960
Wh-What are you doing
with those hands?!

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:16.050
How about this?

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:22.200
Not bad.

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:24.430
Then what about this?

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:26.170
It's all right.

00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:29.880
It doesn't exactly scream
"pick me," though.

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:31.400
Oh, it doesn't?

00:01:31.810 --> 00:01:36.150
Everyone will be dressed up
real fancy at this ball thing, right?

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:38.320
Even though I'm just after the meat,

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:43.240
this daughter of dragonkind isn't gonna be outdone by any nitwitted human!

00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:44.970
I understand!

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:49.000
I'll find just the right
gown for you, Miss Eco.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.270
I'll crush you if you don't.

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:55.840
I'm bored stiff.

00:01:55.840 --> 00:02:00.220
It's not like it matters what
a man wears to these things.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:01.860
Yes?

00:02:01.860 --> 00:02:02.920
It's me.

00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:04.520
Princess?!

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:10.900
May I?

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:56.460
<i>What's going on here?
Wh-What </i>is<i> all this?</i>

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:59.720
<i>Why am I sitting beside
the princess... on my bed?</i>

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:04.260
<i>And what's </i>that<i> supposed to mean?!</i>

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:11.770
Uh, P-Princess, don't you
have a fitting right now?

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:14.590
M-My gown is being altered.

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:17.080
It's become tighter across
the chest this past year, so...

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:19.320
Now look what you made me say!

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:20.590
S-Sorry!

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:25.780
Is something bothering you?

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:31.290
Yeah. Will you hear me out?

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:42.290
Nope.

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:45.800
Nope!

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:51.530
Are you messing
with me or something?

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:53.810
N-Not at all!

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:58.780
You're just so demanding, Miss Eco.

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:02.860
I told you. As a dragon, I have to be better than those humans!

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:05.000
Especially that Silvia.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:07.870
Do you dislike Princess Silvia?

00:05:08.970 --> 00:05:10.910
Not exactly,

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:13.970
but she's been getting awfully friendly with Ash lately.

00:05:13.970 --> 00:05:17.920
It makes me feel all mixed-up inside.

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:21.150
You certainly have it rough, Miss Eco.

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:22.250
How so?

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:26.050
Well, Ash is human,
and you're a dragon.

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:30.600
One day he'll fall in love with a human girl, get married,

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:33.560
have babies, and...

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:39.630
Ash is human,
and you're a dragon.

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:43.980
One day he'll fall in love with a human girl, get married,

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:46.940
have babies, and...

00:05:55.890 --> 00:05:57.410
Miss Eco?

00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:00.920
Milgauss is Prince Julius?!

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:08.800
Father could never bring himself to go through with the execution.

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:11.300
The way Father was acting yesterday...

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:13.810
The stolen ashes...

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:16.810
What Milgauss said at
the Willingham Mausoleum...

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:20.310
That first Necromancia...

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:23.070
The clues were all there.

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:26.460
I just didn't see them.

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:32.050
I'd be genuinely happy
if my brother were still alive...

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:34.760
but what should I do now?

00:06:35.900 --> 00:06:37.720
You know, my dad...

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:43.280
He packed up and left right after my little sister was born.

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:46.860
We were forbidden to
talk about him after that.

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:50.250
But one day, I asked my mom,

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:52.730
"Why did Dad leave?"

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:54.220
And?

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:56.780
She didn't answer.

00:06:56.780 --> 00:07:03.890
But she promised she'd tell me when
I was older and could understand better.

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:06.730
So I stopped obsessing about it.

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:08.050
What I mean is this.

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:09.820
Rather than spending your time worrying and wondering,

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:13.480
it'd be faster to corner
the guy and ask him.

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:14.120
Right?

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:18.670
That's easier said than done.

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:20.340
But you're right.

00:07:21.030 --> 00:07:21.920
Thank you.

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:24.780
It's nothing.

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:42.190
U-Um...

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:46.940
U-Uh, Princess?

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:02.080
A-Are you all right?

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:05.820
The lightning's pretty far
off now, so you can let go.

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:26.620
<i>N-No! No, no, no, no, no!</i>

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:28.820
<i>What the hell am I thinking?!</i>

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:32.820
<i>She's the fourth princess of
Lautreamont Knight Country!</i>

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:36.820
<i>She's preoccupied with
this whole Prince Julius thing!</i>

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:38.430
<i>I can't...</i>

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:58.480
Pardon me, Princess.

00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:01.110
The alterations to
your gown are finished.

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:07.100
I-Is that so? I'll be right there.

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:11.730
Pardon the intrusion.

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:21.500
Say...

00:09:23.280 --> 00:09:25.420
What's keeping Eco?

00:09:28.990 --> 00:09:30.880
<i>I knew full well.</i>

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:34.880
<i>I knew all along, and yet...
this tightness in my chest...</i>

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:40.390
One day he'll fall in love with a human girl, get married...

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:46.090
One day he'll fall in love with a human girl, get married,

00:09:46.090 --> 00:09:49.440
have babies, and...

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:02.970
<i>Ash is a human, and I'm a dragon.</i>

00:10:02.970 --> 00:10:06.330
<i>When he starts a family, I'll...</i>

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:08.830
But... that's...

00:10:15.820 --> 00:10:16.840
Eco?

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:24.850
She's gone. And with the ball
starting any minute too.

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:27.850
Is something wrong, Master Ash?

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:39.220
Where...

00:10:43.390 --> 00:10:44.830
I got lost.

00:10:54.390 --> 00:10:57.590
<i>What the... What are they doing there?</i>

00:10:57.850 --> 00:10:59.130
<i>It's her.</i>

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:00.840
Where are you?!

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:02.850
Miss Eco!

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:07.770
Stay back! Get out of here!

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:11.600
Eco's gone?

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:14.270
Yeah. I can't find Prim, either.

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:16.230
I understand.

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:19.600
Please attend the ball as planned.

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:20.520
But...

00:11:20.520 --> 00:11:26.360
We servants know this castle like the backs of our hands.

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:27.820
Please don't worry.

00:11:27.820 --> 00:11:29.830
We'll find her before you know it.

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:33.830
Thanks. I appreciate it.

00:11:51.550 --> 00:11:54.230
Where could she be?

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:55.280
Ash?

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:01.500
I heard about Eco and Prim.

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:06.370
No need to worry. Cosette will
find them right away.

00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:09.330
Yeah, you're right.

00:12:16.530 --> 00:12:18.000
Milgauss!

00:12:18.490 --> 00:12:20.210
What are <i>you</i> doing here?!

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:25.520
Dear me! You have business
with my servant?

00:12:25.520 --> 00:12:27.810
Just a case of mistaken identity.

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:31.120
Wait!

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:33.730
Stop. I've seen that noble before.

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:34.520
What?

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:40.030
He's representing the Zepharos Empire at the Continental Congress.

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:43.950
Margrave Klaus Vandenhul.

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:06.240
Stay back! Get out of here!

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:07.140
Huh?

00:13:31.350 --> 00:13:38.100
<i>As long as I carry out
Master Milgauss's orders...</i>

00:13:50.280 --> 00:13:52.030
Quit glaring at him, Ash.

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:52.720
Huh?

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:58.740
He may be from the Empire,
but he wouldn't dare start anything here.

00:13:58.740 --> 00:13:59.480
But...

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:02.480
Focus more on your footwork. You're terribly out of step.

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:04.720
That's easy for you to say.

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:07.240
I've only learned the basics so far.

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:12.040
Thank you, Ash.

00:14:12.040 --> 00:14:15.640
I feel better now that
I've confided in you.

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:16.750
Princess...

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:19.540
M-Make no mistake.

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:24.250
I'm thanking you for
listening to me. That's all.

00:14:25.850 --> 00:14:27.260
Yeah, yeah.

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:32.120
No sign of Miss Eco
on these floors.

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:33.760
Nor these.

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:36.770
So that leaves...

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:40.850
I was so nervous.

00:14:41.510 --> 00:14:45.260
Do you think this is tougher than the Dragonar battle skills exam?

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:46.710
Maybe so.

00:14:46.710 --> 00:14:49.280
What a marvelous dance that was!

00:14:50.010 --> 00:14:53.780
Won't you dance
another round with me?

00:14:54.180 --> 00:14:56.790
Another dance? Gladly. But...

00:14:58.050 --> 00:15:00.290
with that gentleman there.

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:13.300
Cosette!

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:15.000
It's Prim!

00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:29.150
I've never seen anyone
dance so beautifully.

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:36.160
Are you my brother?

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:42.420
Why did you call me Silvie?

00:15:43.090 --> 00:15:47.420
The Necromancia in Durham Square... Was that Mordred?

00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:48.420
Answer me!

00:15:50.850 --> 00:15:55.430
Is it considered proper in Knight Country to ask questions during a dance?

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:00.450
Princess!

00:16:00.450 --> 00:16:02.940
How did it go? Is he...

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.940
I'm not certain. However...

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:10.940
he definitely dances in
the Knight Country style.

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:14.950
Princess Silvia, Master Ash.

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:18.450
We've found Prim.

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:21.460
Please forgive me, Master Ash!

00:16:21.720 --> 00:16:24.040
Why are you apologizing?

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:25.310
What happened?

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:27.990
If I hadn't said what I did...

00:16:27.990 --> 00:16:29.210
Said what?

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:33.720
That Miss Eco was a dragon,
and you were a human.

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:39.490
That one day you'd marry
a human girl and have babies

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:43.230
and inevitably leave Miss Eco sad.

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:44.230
You imbecile!

00:16:45.570 --> 00:16:50.380
Eco's a dragon, sure, but inside
she may as well be a human girl.

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:56.080
Why was she born in human form, instead of looking like a dragon?

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:59.930
If I were Eco, I know I'd be fretting about that very question.

00:16:59.930 --> 00:17:00.880
And you...

00:17:01.360 --> 00:17:03.460
I'm so sorry!

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:06.250
That's enough, Princess.

00:17:06.980 --> 00:17:08.760
Thank you.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:14.220
Prim says Miss Eco was
abducted at the old palace.

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:15.590
Abducted?!

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:20.940
Who was behind it?
What did they look like?

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:23.620
They looked like they
were from the palace.

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:28.770
Oh, but the maid who seemed like the leader was a Tantalos girl.

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:31.780
A Tantalos girl?

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:33.780
Milgauss!

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:35.410
Wait!

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:38.090
It's pointless to confront him directly.

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:38.960
But...

00:17:38.960 --> 00:17:44.290
We scoured the castle for Miss Eco, but she's nowhere to be found.

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:48.380
If they've abducted her,
they don't want to kill her.

00:17:48.610 --> 00:17:52.410
Where would be a safe place to hide her during the ball?

00:17:53.990 --> 00:17:57.390
Margrave Klaus Vandenhul's airship.

00:17:57.390 --> 00:17:58.550
<i>Beowulf</i> !

00:18:13.420 --> 00:18:15.480
There you are, Anya.

00:18:15.480 --> 00:18:18.140
The experiment has begun, I see.

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:20.160
It's going smoothly so far.

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:24.160
Ubermana Beam No. 11, prepare to fire.

00:18:24.680 --> 00:18:27.290
Cartridge loaded. Preparations complete.

00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:31.280
Commence countdown.

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:43.360
Ten, nine, eight, seven, six,
five, four, three, two,

00:18:43.360 --> 00:18:44.710
one.

00:18:44.710 --> 00:18:46.430
Ubermana Beam No. 11,

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:47.930
fire!

00:18:57.760 --> 00:19:03.160
We're shooting her with a concentrated beam of the immense amount of mana in Millennium.

00:19:03.920 --> 00:19:11.420
Yggdrasil here can forcefully awaken adult dragons that never became Maestros.

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:20.650
Millennium, the mana-rich crystals said to
come from thousand-year-old dragon fossils.

00:19:20.650 --> 00:19:23.480
We give that mana to our subject...

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:26.430
...in order to make her
reveal her true form.

00:19:27.870 --> 00:19:31.190
<i>Am I going to die like this?</i>

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:33.690
Ubermana Beam No. 12,

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:35.100
fire!

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:44.370
Ow! It hurts!

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:46.000
It hurts!

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:50.280
Stop. Please... Please!

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:53.880
No change to Subject Alpha.

00:19:54.980 --> 00:19:57.130
I guess we have no choice.

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:59.760
Set Millennium output to the maximum.

00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:06.260
<i>Eco!</i>

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:13.890
<i>No!</i>

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:17.900
<i>Ash!</i>

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:19.900
<i>Ash...</i>

00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:24.160
<i>I can't feel it. My connection to Ash...</i>

00:20:25.710 --> 00:20:28.620
How stupid can I get?

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:32.160
This is what it took
for me to realize...

00:20:32.890 --> 00:20:36.170
my feelings... for Ash.

00:20:36.930 --> 00:20:38.880
All Millennium engaged.

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:45.680
Final Ubermana Beam,

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:46.680
fire.

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:12.660
Wh-What's this?!

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:15.670
The mana detector has picked up an unknown mana reaction!

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:17.820
Yggdrasil is out of control!

00:21:17.820 --> 00:21:20.170
It's not accepting the
emergency shutdown signal!

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:22.590
Wh-What?

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:33.860
Quick, stop the device,
before it runs wild!

00:21:33.860 --> 00:21:36.160
No chance of that.

00:21:36.160 --> 00:21:36.730
Huh?

00:21:37.140 --> 00:21:44.740
All that energy harvested from the Millennium has been absorbed into Subject Alpha's body.

00:21:57.860 --> 00:21:59.500
E-Eco?

00:22:05.870 --> 00:22:07.200
Princess! Look!

00:22:07.200 --> 00:22:09.510
<i>Beowulf</i>... What's going on?

00:22:12.110 --> 00:22:13.010
Ash?

00:22:17.310 --> 00:22:19.160
Ash! What is it?!

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:23.020
I don't know, but something's happened to Eco, for sure.

00:22:28.420 --> 00:22:29.360
Ash!

00:22:51.040 --> 00:22:52.930
It couldn't be...

00:22:53.340 --> 00:22:54.500
Eco's in there?

00:24:46.880 --> 00:24:48.950
So please... Please!
